Chapter One – Become a Reading Volunteer – (30 mins) [1st Item]

Through Chapter One's virtual reading programme, you can support a young reader in just 30 minutes a week. It fits around your work, it's fully supported, and no teaching experience is needed.

Location: Virtual

Time commitment: 30mins per week during term time

Register here using your company email 

Benefits 

